# rtl/ and tb/ from commit 8ab78aa (0 uncommitted changes)

The testbench says PASS only if all three bit-exact checks match the golden
model on every image. Columns: images where the check matched, out of 300.

mutant            | what it models                                                               | verdict | hidden  | layer-2  | digit   | accuracy
00_original       | nothing planted: the RTL as committed                                        | PASS    | 300/300 | 300/300  | 300/300 | 98.33%
01_unsigned_base  | accumulator base left unsigned, so negative products are zero-extended       | FAIL    | 0/300   | 0/300    | 34/300  | 11.33%
02_acc16          | 16-bit accumulators instead of 24                                            | FAIL    | 96/300  | 0/300    | 248/300 | 81.00%
03_no_round       | rounding term missing from requantization                                    | FAIL    | 0/300   | 0/300    | 299/300 | 98.33%
04_argmax_ge      | argmax keeps the last maximum on ties (>= instead of >)                      | PASS    | 300/300 | 300/300  | 300/300 | 98.33%

